  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "One atomic transaction",
      "items": [
        "The final auxiliary-pool fee capture, unlock, unified settlement, and protection-window opening all complete in one transaction",
        "Any failed step reverts the whole transaction; the Verse stays Locked and the process can be re-initiated",
        "Protection window: 24 hours; the standard side can exit principal while pools are static"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Recovery and repayment",
      "items": [
        "Auxiliary-pool shares are cut out pro rata to the leveraged debt; rounding remainders go to the standard side",
        "POL is burned to redeem; PT swaps into uAsset at par",
        "Recovered uAsset repays the full leveraged debt first",
        "Leveraged participants also receive leveraged YT, pro rata to the interest each paid"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Surplus and shortfall",
      "items": [
        "Surplus: residual value = remaining uAsset + all recovered Memecoin, distributed once pro rata to interest paid, claimable forever",
        "Shortfall: the settlement reserve covers only a capped rounding-level shortfall, never insolvency",
        "A shortfall over the reserve reverts the whole transaction; once the reserve is replenished (cap may be raised) it is retried",
        "Captured fees: POL-denominated fees are burned; uAsset fees go to the DAO treasury"
      ]
    }
